      "edition": "The Liturgical Year, Septuagesima, translated from the French of Dom Prosper Guéranger; printing of 1909 (Stanbrook Abbey / Duffy). Internet Archive scan, OCR text.",
      "description": "Split at each day or feast heading detected in the running text; running heads and page numbers removed; the Latin and English columns of the liturgical texts, interleaved line by line in the OCR, were separated by language and set as a Latin paragraph followed by its English.",
